# Secrets. Neither belongs in the build context: the build stage is COPY . .,
# so anything reachable here lands in that stage's layer and stays visible
# through `--target build`, a cache export, or `docker history` on it — even
# though the runtime stage copies only dist. `.env` holds TURN_SECRET for the
# relay; coturn/turnserver.conf holds the same secret for coturn.
.env*
coturn/
